The UI process knows a message is the background page’s by the view the
page is in, not by its path, as WebKit’s WebExtensionContext::
runtimeSendMessage() fills in sender details from its own state. A
reload replaces the background view, as WebKit’s WebExtensionContext::
unload() unloads the old background content, and a failed load settles
the waiting messages, as WebKit’s didFailNavigation() unloads a
background that failed to load.
